  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Output of the above circuit can be obtained as<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi></math>,&nbsp;which is XOR gate</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e96252bc-0437-4416-bfb8-7d16bc09bc2c-d44.png\" style=\"width: 496px; height: 180px;\" /></p>",
